<title>SINGAPORE: SNP Corp says 1997 outlook not rosy.</title>
<headline>SNP Corp says 1997 outlook not rosy.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printing and publishing firm SNP Corp Ltd said on Wednesday after announcing its 1996 net plunged 79.4 percent that it did not expect to see better results this year.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the group would have to re-position itself on new information technology and multimedia products and services.</p>
<p>The company said &quot;it did not expect an improvement in this year's results.&quot;</p>
<p>Its 1996 profits were Singapore $0.72 million against S$3.5 million in 1995.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703305)</p>
